(7508311, 1197635, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>Thank goodness for Hou Yi! A very striking image with an animated character of bright vibrant colours, it is not easily ignored! Ican imagine it tells the fable to those already familiar with it and with your explanation to those not familiar with such as I. I think I understand why you have chosen to include the structure but I rather wish the sun was on its own. But overall Gin Tay your image has impact, well done.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge Thank goodness for Hou Yi! A very striking image with an animated character of bright vibrant colours, it is not easily ignored! Ican imagine it tells the fable to those already familiar with it and with your explanation to those not familiar with such as I. I think I understand why you have chosen to include the structure but I rather wish the sun was on its own. But overall Gin Tay your image has impact, well done.', '2017-04-08 17:08:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7508312, 1197619, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>A lovely composition that draws the viewer in though I would prefer the close cropping of the towers, if it has to be done, to have been in the sky rather the water. The other problem I have is the over saturation of the colours which I assume is deliberate for the challenge but I feel it detracts rather than adds impact to the end result. Other than that, it is an appealing image, well done Jonathon</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge A lovely composition that draws the viewer in though I would prefer the close cropping of the towers, if it has to be done, to have been in the sky rather the water. The other problem I have is the over saturation of the colours which I assume is deliberate for the challenge but I feel it detracts rather than adds impact to the end result. Other than that, it is an appealing image, well done Jonathon', '2017-04-08 17:14:20.000000', NULL, 0),
